WEBVTT

00:07.461 --> 00:08.122
Hey! Hey!

00:36.487 --> 00:37.796
You're such a liar!

00:53.171 --> 00:56.172
We're caught in the friction, dragging the

00:56.212 --> 01:00.673
weight A system of rest locked outside the gate

01:00.713 --> 01:03.394
But the engine will ignite, the circuit's

01:03.454 --> 01:07.976
turned on The artificial gravity's completely

01:08.036 --> 01:11.997
gone We're building momentum, we're breaking

01:12.057 --> 01:16.118
the

01:16.518 --> 01:19.779
line We're leaving the old world so far behind

01:22.637 --> 01:28.139
We've got an F sure A force they can't contain

01:30.120 --> 01:33.702
Speeding through the static Breaking the chain

01:33.982 --> 01:37.704
We are unstoppable Moving through the night

01:37.784 --> 01:44.787
We've got an F sure Riding on the lights

01:49.363 --> 01:53.244
They try to calculate, try to chart our course,

01:53.364 --> 01:56.325
but they never understood the nature of the

01:56.445 --> 02:01.366
force. Energy conserved, never truly lost. We

02:01.406 --> 02:06.108
paid for our freedom and we know the cost. We're

02:06.148 --> 02:09.108
building momentum, we're breaking the

02:12.709 --> 02:18.351
line. We're leaving the old world so far behind.

02:19.327 --> 02:24.850
We've got inertia A force they can't contain

02:26.812 --> 02:30.414
Speeding through the static Breaking the chain

02:30.694 --> 02:34.376
We are unstoppable Moving through the night

02:34.476 --> 02:46.704
We've got inertia Riding on the light

03:13.858 --> 03:14.638
Two.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.821
One.

03:25.240 --> 03:32.948
No equal reaction can slow down this fraction A

03:33.028 --> 03:35.852
stardust and sound, we are leaving the ground

03:40.637 --> 03:45.722
We've got inertia, a force they can't contain

03:48.101 --> 03:51.582
Speeding through the static Breaking the chain

03:51.962 --> 03:55.683
We are unstoppable Moving through the night

03:55.743 --> 04:04.225
We've got inertia Above it all Riding on the

04:04.265 --> 04:08.026
light

04:10.126 --> 04:11.347
Save me

